Terminus Forge: Time After Sometimes~
   Amir wipes his brown and slings his hefty black hammer over his shoulder.
He eyes the sky with his good side.
   'There's no fire like the fire from the heavens,' he says. 'We have forged
here for many years by cheating time.'
   He taps at the stone tree stump with his foot.
   'But now time is catching up with us. It has stalked us like a dragon in the
reeds. Time comes for all of us, in the end. Sometimes, it is better to face it
head on.'
   If you're ready to prove your mettle against the predator in time, type
'challenge' from Amir, the Last Watch's location at Terminus Forge. If you want
to ensure a private arena, type 'challenge empty'. You can return from the
challenge by typing 'return' from the battlefield.
~
   It seems time hasn't caught up with you just yet. You finally catch your
breath after fighting for your life in freefall, having proven to yourself that
you can stand toe to toe with the worst history has to offer.
   You can challenge the Lion of Time again as many times as you want by typing
'challenge' or 'challenge empty' from Amir, the Last Watch's location in
Terminus Forge. However, it will only reward you with a shatterable impact
print once per day.
   Remember, you can always return from the challenge by typing 'return' from
the battlefield.
~
